d from supplier records. The pcpA/pcpB/pcpC/linA panel is therefore hypothesis-driven rather than matched to a known chemistry, and its emptiness cannot separate \"the community lacks the catabolic route\" from \"this timber never carried that biocide\". Copper is the safer primary axis because copper tolerance is interpretable whatever the formulation -- copper cannot be catabolised, it is an element.")
